<title>LATVIA: RIGA SHIPYARD SHARES SOLD FOR 1.39 LATS.</title>
<headline>RIGA SHIPYARD SHARES SOLD FOR 1.39 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Riga Shipyard's public offer for cash was completed on Monday at auction at 1.39 lats per share and was sold out, the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>&quot;Riga Shipyard public offer for cash was completed today at auction at a price of 1.39 lats,&quot; a spokeswoman for the stock exchange told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;Everything on offer was sold,&quot; she added.  </p>
<p>The Latvian Privatisation Agency earlier set the minimum price for the 8.37 percent of the Riga Shipyard state stake or 837,140 shares at 1.30 lats.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
